   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inflection of the attributive adjective",
     "texto": [
      "When an adjective stands in front of the noun it describes, it almost always takes the ending «-e»: «de nieuwe fiets» (the new bicycle), «de grote tafel» (the big table). The main exception occurs when the noun is neuter (a «het» word) and is preceded by the indefinite article «een» (or has no article): «een nieuw boek» (a new book), «een klein huis» (a small house), where the adjective has no -e."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
